		{"id":"f048a00000000005","type":"group","x":0,"y":2100,"width":1500,"height":1150,"label":"5 · 波浪与选讲缺口","color":"3"},
		{"id":"f048a00000000006","type":"group","x":1750,"y":2100,"width":1500,"height":1150,"label":"6 · 指标计算与边界","color":"2"},
		{"id":"f048a00000000007","type":"group","x":0,"y":3400,"width":1500,"height":1100,"label":"7 · 信号 → 成交 → 账本","color":"4"},
		{"id":"f048a00000000008","type":"group","x":1750,"y":3400,"width":1500,"height":1100,"label":"8 · 验证与风险比较","color":"1"},
		{"id":"f048000000000800","type":"text","x":0,"y":-340,"width":3250,"height":250,"text":"# 证券技术分析\n\n阅读路径：先界定行情与假设，再读趋势、形态和指标，最后把规则放进真实可得信息、成交与账户路径中检验。颜色区分分析层次；箭头只表达标明的关系。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nRead inputs and assumptions, then trends, patterns, and indicators; finally test rules using contemporaneously available information, execution, and account paths. Colors distinguish analytical layers, and arrows carry only their stated meanings.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n[[02_Economy/06_证券投资学/08_证券技术分析|证券投资学连续阅读]] · [[02_Economy/06_证券投资学/证券投资学 Course Atlas.canvas|全课位置]]"},
		{"id":"f048000000000001","type":"text","x":40,"y":70,"width":1420,"height":100,"text":"## [[证券技术分析]]"},
		{"id":"f048000000000002","type":"text","x":40,"y":280,"width":310,"height":90,"text":"## [[市场行为涵盖信息假设]]"},
		{"id":"f048000000000003","type":"text","x":590,"y":280,"width":310,"height":90,"text":"## [[趋势延续假设]]"},
		{"id":"f048000000000004","type":"text","x":1140,"y":280,"width":310,"height":90,"text":"## [[历史重复假设]]"},
		{"id":"f048000000000801","type":"text","x":40,"y":470,"width":1420,"height":270,"text":"### 从可见行情提出可检验规则\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFrom observed data to testable rules\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n三个研究假设不是对未来价格的保证。每条数据、转折点和标签都要记录何时真正可用，按[[预测时点与信息集]]限定交易输入。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nThe three assumptions do not guarantee future prices. Record when each observation, pivot, and label becomes available; [[预测时点与信息集|prediction time and information sets]] constrain trading inputs.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"f048000000000009","type":"text","x":1790,"y":70,"width":310,"height":90,"text":"## [[价格趋势]]"},
		{"id":"f048000000000010","type":"text","x":2340,"y":70,"width":310,"height":90,"text":"## [[道氏理论]]"},
		{"id":"f048000000000011","type":"text","x":2890,"y":70,"width":310,"height":90,"text":"## [[道氏趋势层级]]"},
